  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0 is a breaking fail-closed release. High-level reads and mutations preserve HTTP, authentication, transport, timeout, protocol, and serialization failures instead of returning default values. It adds D365Response, typed exceptions, mutation outcomes, strict counts, validated pagination, bounded read retries, cancellation, named singleton clients, and single-flight token refresh. Migration guide: https://github.com/FlintsLabs/FlintsLabs.D365.ODataClient/blob/v2.0.0/docs/v2/migration-from-v1.md",
